<div id="divBetLimitInstructions">
    <div class="betlimit-instructions">
        <p>Single Game, Min Single Bet and Single Bet for each product (Sport type) are defined here.</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Single Game: the maximum stake allowed on a match.</li>
            <li>Single Bet: the maximum stake allowed on a bet.</li>
            <li>Min Single Bet: the minimum stake allowed on a bet.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="note">Note:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>">= X" means Input must be greater than or equal to X.</li>
            <li>[x - y]: input range. If K is the entered amount, then K must be x <= K <= y.</li>
            <li>0 < Min single bet <= Single Bet <= Single Game</li>
            <li>Decimal numbers are not allowed. For instance, 100.25 is an invalid input.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>